From ce0afbd5716e65f69bc175640187c9149df9dabd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: desocketed <desocketed@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 23:34:32 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] input: NX2NAVI_MOTION_PAD, the six-axis sensor reads another
 open gamepad's gyro and accelerometer when the one in use has none (a virtual
 pad beside the real controller); that pad never becomes the one the game
 reads

---
